<title>HUNGARY: Zwack plans an unchanged 15pct div on 1996.</title>
<headline>Zwack plans an unchanged 15pct div on 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian spirits maker Zwack Rt plans to pay a 15 percent dividend on 1996 earnings, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Zwack also paid a 15 percent dividend on 1995 earnings.</p>
<p>The company will hold its annual shareholders meeting on May 28.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
